#%PAM-1.0
# Fingerprint half of the lock (modules/lock/PamFingerprint.qml); the password
# goes through `flicker`. One try per round (a miss shakes the field, then the
# lock starts a new round); a round listens `timeout` seconds and is restarted
# after it. No reader / no fprintd = an error at once, the lock stops asking.

auth    required    pam_fprintd.so      max-tries=1 timeout=300
